  "question": "If '÷' means '+', '-' means '×', '+' means '-' and, '×' means '÷', then which of the following equations is correct?",
  "options": [
    {
      "label": "1",
      "text": "42 × 28 - 30 ÷ 48 + 45 = 45"
    },
    {
      "label": "2",
      "text": "42 × 28 - 30 ÷ 48 + 45 = 50"
    },
    {
      "label": "3",
      "text": "42 × 28 - 30 ÷ 48 + 45 = 48"
